  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B2B DOC Documentary film Network East 2017 - 2020 - B2B DOC Documentary film East - Phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B2B DOC Dokument&#xe4;rfilm &#xd6;st 2017 - 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen bidrar till &quot;&#xf6;kad interaktivitet och kapacitet i regionens dokumentarfilmindustri, vilket &#xf6;kar h&#xe5;llbarheten i aff&#xe4;rsinitiativ och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrar f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r demokrati och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i post-sovjetregionen&quot;.
Detta kommer att uppn&#xe5;s genom:
- Partnerskap - det &#xe4;r ett praktiskt s&#xe4;tt f&#xf6;r dokument&#xe4;rfilmare i post-sovjetregionen att utbyta id&#xe9;er och hitta s&#xe4;tt att samarbeta med filmskapare i Sverige och Baltikum

- F&#xf6;rst&#xe5; och l&#xe4;ra sig verksamheten - det &#xe4;r en inl&#xe4;rningsprocess f&#xf6;r dessa filmskapare om hur man bedriver verksamhet p&#xe5; en snabbt skiftande internationell mediemarknad

- Demokrati och yttrandefrihet - Det handlar om demokratiska v&#xe4;rderingar, transparens och inf&#xf6;rande av j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet som en faktor f&#xf6;r filmskapande och urval av projekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative contributes to &quot;increased interactivity and capacity in the region&apos;s documentary industry, which increases the sustainability of business initiatives and enhances the conditions for democracy and human rights in the post-Soviet region.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is &quot;enhanced interactivity and capacity of the regions documentary film industry, thus increasing the sustainability of business initiatives and improving conditions for democracy and human rights in the post-Soviet region&quot;.
The project has three outcomes (referred to as main purposes in the project proposal), each with its own objective:
1. Partnerships: Established relations and partnerships between filmmakers, production companies, film schools, media industry, public institutions and distributors through networking and physical meetings.
2. Understanding and learning the business: Increased knowledge among the cooperation partners on how business and co-production is conducted in a rapidly changing European media market.
3. Democracy and freedom of speech: Enhanced appreciation of the values of democracy, freedom of speech and gender equality in the documentary film business among co-operation partners.</narrative>
  </description>
